items.title:
io.vidocq.ravel:ravel-processor 0.4.0-RC2 发布, Annotation processor for applications: generates, in the application's packages, the factories of the
        @ConfigProperties classes and the implicit converters of the injected types, so Ravel fills and converts
        them with plain code instead of reflection. Build-time only; nothing of it ships in the application.

